INFO:__main__:ID 31 Answer: In the conversation between Day 1 entries, Shure mentions placing his pen on the table during [DAY1 11:25:01–11:25:30]. He also writes “EGO life” and refers to being part of the discussion involving others like Katriona and Lucia. There’s no mention of anyone else handling the black signature pen directly before or after this moment—only Shure acts upon having access to such a tool when he walks toward the whiteboard and begins writing. Therefore, since only Shure explicitly handles any kind of pen-related activity near the timeline mentioned—and specifically references putting things away—he must have been the latest user.

Final Answer: D, Gold: C, Correct: False // Accuracy: 12/31 = 0.3871 // Abstained: 0 // Done: 38/50
