Therefore Given Choices Are All Fast Food Chains Only Option Matching Likely Scenario Where People Might Order Out Instead Of Cook Themselves Due To Large Group Size (~20), Complexity Issues Related To Cooking/Baking Preparations Required When Handling Big Groups Such As School Teachers & Students Together Who May Have Different Dietary Needs/Eating Habits.

